<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_0">%s hat herausgefunden, wie {3} gemacht wird! DafÃ¼r sind {1} und {2} nÃ¶tig.</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_1">%s hat hart gearbeitet und etwas entdeckt: {1} und {2} kÃ¶nnen kombiniert werden. Das Ergebnis: {3}</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_2">%s will ein geheimes {3}-Rezept mit dir teilen: {1} und {2}. Aber nicht weitersagen ;)</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_3">Fragst du dich immer noch, wie {3} hergestellt wird? Die LÃ¶sung: {1} und {2}. %s ist darauf gekommen.</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_4">%s hat zum SpaÃŸ etwas kombiniert. {1} und {2} ergibt etwas Neues. Das verblÃ¼ffende Ergebnis: {3}.</String><String name="SOCIAL_FOUND">Ich habe ein neues Element gefunden!</String><String name="SOCIAL_AND">und</String><String name="SOCIAL_USERNAME_DUMMY">Dein Freund</String><String name="SOCIAL_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">Ich habe Folgendes herausgefunden: %s + %s = %s! Hol dir Doodle God -</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TEMPLATE">Toll! Ich habe gerade eine neue Errungenschaft gemacht: "%s".\nUnd was hast du in Doodle God erreicht?\nBesuche unsere Seite www.doodlegod.com und erfahre die jÃ¼ngsten Neuigkeiten.\nSpiele Doodle Devil - entdecke deine dunkle Seite!</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TEMPLATE_SHORT">Toll! Ich habe gerade eine neue Errungenschaft gemacht: "%s".</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">Toll! Ich habe gerade eine neue Errungenschaft gemacht: "%s".\nSpiele Doodle Devil - entdecke deine dunkle Seite!</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="BLITZ_UNLOCK_DESC">Buy the full version of the game for just %d mana and get Eternal Glow and free access to all episodes! No more waiting or locked objects!</String><String name="QUEST_PRINCESS_ADVERTISING_MSG">Something terrible has happened! A dragon has kidnapped the princess and only you can save her! Hurry!</String><String name="QUEST_PRINCESS_ADVERTISING_BUTTON">To battle!</String><String name="QUEST_DEVIL_VS_GOD_ADVERTISING_MSG">Good and Evil will clash in a fierce battle, and you decide the outcome. Put an end to this eternal conflict!</String><String name="OPTIONS_FULLSCREEN">Fullscreen</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_PUMPKIN">Jack-o-Lantern</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_PUMPKIN_DESC">What's Halloween without pumpkins?</String><String name="PUZ_PUMPKIN_WIN_MSG">The pumpkin turned out great â€” now you can give the neighbors a scare!</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_DEFAULT">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_1">Continue playing Doodle God now</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_1DAY_1">OK</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS">Your Universe is waiting the Creator</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_3DAYS">Play!</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS">Do you have any ideas for new elements?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_7DAYS">I do!</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_2">Daily bonus awaits you. Come back to Doodle God.</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_3">Divine glow restored its power.</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_4">You didn't visit Doodle God for a while.</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_5">Time to create new artifacts in Doodle God.</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_6">There are discounts and sales in Doodle God.</String><String name="NOTIFY_1DAY_7">New elements wait to be created.</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS_1">New puzzles wait to be solved.</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS_2">Your help in completing quests is required.</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS_3">Hurry to solve the mystery of artifacts creation.</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS_4">Time to create new elements.</String><String name="NOTIFY_3DAYS_5">Doodle God world misses its creator.</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS_1">Don't miss your fortune! Daily bonus awaits you.</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS_2">Have you figured out what new elements you will create?</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS_3">Unique sales started in Doodle God.</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS_4">Element %s is available for reaction.</String><String name="NOTIFY_7DAYS_5">What if you create %s?</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_1">Come back and play Doodle God. We miss you!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_2">You've only just begun. A new universe awaits in Doodle God.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_2">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_4">Do you have any ideas for new elements?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_ALL_4">I do!</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_1_1">Doodle God waits for its creator!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_1_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_1_2">Discover the amazing worlds of Doodle God!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_1_2">Open</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_2_1">Experience the wonders of the Industrial Revolution.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_2_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_2_2">What will you invent? The Universe needs your help.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_2_2">Invent</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_3_1">Your civilization waits for new inventions!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_3_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_3_2">Create more advanced tech and modern devices!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_3_2">Create</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_4_1">Are you a miracle maker? The DoodleGod world waits for new miracles!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_4_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_4_2">Experience the Magic and Miracles. The Doodle God world is waiting!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_MAIN_GAME_4_2">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_SANTA_1">Ho, Ho, Ho..., come back and help Santa.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_SANTA_1">Help him</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_SANTA_2">Help Santa create enough presents for the world!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_SANTA_2">Help</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_PRINCESS_1">Help save the Princess from the Dragon. Only you can rescue her!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_PRINCESS_1">Rescue!</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_PRINCESS_2">The King has offered a great reward for saving the Princess. Do you dare to complete the quest?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_PRINCESS_2">I do!</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_GOOD_1">Are you good or evil?... Decide your fate now!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_GOOD_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_GOOD_2">God or Devil? ... Which side are you on?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_GOOD_2">Find out</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_LOST_1">Can you escape the Desert Island? Play and find out.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_LOST_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_LOST_2">Help the stranded adventurer get off the island before it's too late!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_LOST_2">Help him!</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_20_CENTURY_1">Are you a genious? The 20th Century waits for you.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_20_CENTURY_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_QUEST_20_CENTURY_2">The 20th Century needs your help!</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_QUEST_20_CENTURY_2">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_PUZZLE_GENERIC_1">Are you creative? Play Doodle God and find out.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_PUZZLE_GENERIC_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_PUZZLE_GENERIC_2">Check out the new brain busting Puzzle mode.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_PUZZLE_GENERIC_2">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_1">Come back! You're about to create some rare Artifacts.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_2">Have you collected all of the Artifacts?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_2">Collect</String><String name="NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_3">Experience the wonders of the world in the new Artifact mode</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_ARTIFACTS_3">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_NUDGE_1">Free Hint! Try {1} + {2} now and get back to the fun.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_NUDGE_1">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_NUDGE_2">You can create {3} now. Find out how.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_NUDGE_2">I will</String><String name="NOTIFY_NUDGE_3">{1} + {2} = ?</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_NUDGE_3">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_NUDGE_4">We need your brains! Come back and play</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_NUDGE_4">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_NUDGE_5">We miss you. Please come back :)</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_NUDGE_5">Play</String><String name="NOTIFY_HINT_1">You have FREE hints! Use them to create cool stuff.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_HINT_1">Play!</String><String name="NOTIFY_PENTAGRAM_1">Your Glow has recharged! You can create new elements again.</String><String name="CONFIRM_NOTIFY_PENTAGRAM_1">Play!</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="MISSION_ELEMENT_NAME">"%s" Element</String><String name="MISSION_ELEMENT_DESC">Create the "%s" element and get a reward!</String><String name="MISSION_ELEMENT_REWARD">Reward for completion:</String><String name="MISSION_ELEMENT_CONGRATULATION">Congratulations!\nYou've completed the mission "%s"!</String><String name="NEW_MISSION_AVAILABLE">New Mission Available</String><String name="NEW_MISSION">New Mission</String><String name="PLANET_NEW_FEATURE">New!</String><String name="PLANET_TUTORIAL">By discovering some special elements, you add them to your world. The more elements you find, the more beautiful this world gets!</String><String name="PLANET_HINT1">Tap here to create new elements</String><String name="PLANET_HINT2">Complete missions to get bonuses!</String><String name="PLANET_HINT3">Tap here to see the current mission</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="SOCIAL_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">I discovered that %s + %s = %s! Get Doodle God -</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TEMPLATE">Wow! I've just earned new achievement: "%s".\nAnd what have you achieved in Doodle God?\nVisit our site www.doodlegod.com and check out latest news.\nPlay Doodle Devil - unleash your Dark Side!</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">Wow! I've just earned new achievement: "%s".\nPlay Doodle Devil - unleash your Dark Side!</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Alphabet></Alphabet><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="ART_NAME_GODZILLA">Godzilla</String><String name="ART_DESC_GODZILLA">Godzilla is a giant monster, which first appeard in the 1954 film Godzilla. With the atomic bombings of Hiroshima, Nagasaki, and the Daigo FukuryÅ« Maru incident still fresh in the Japanese consciousness, Godzilla was conceived as a monster created by nuclear detonations and a metaphor for nuclear weapons in general.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_GODZILLA">A huge monster from the sea depths.</String><String name="ART_NAME_PERPET">Perpetual</String><String name="ART_DESC_PERPET">The motion of a hypothetical machine which, once activated, would run forever unless it was subjected to external force or to wear.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_PERPET">Impossible machine</String><String name="ART_NAME_TITANIC">Titanic</String><String name="ART_DESC_TITANIC">The Titanic was a British passenger liner that sank in the North Atlantic Ocean on April 15th, 1912 after colliding with an iceberg during her maiden voyage from Southampton, UK to New York City, USA. The sinking of Titanic caused the deaths of 1,502 people in one of the deadliest peacetime maritime disasters in modern history.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_TITANIC">The last word in comfort and luxury. Drowned.</String><String name="ART_NAME_PBOX">Pandora's box</String><String name="ART_DESC_PBOX">Pandora's Box is an artifact in Greek mythology. The "box" was actually a large jar given to Pandora  which contained all the evils of the world. Today, the phrase "to open Pandora's box" means to perform an action that may seem small or innocuous, but that turns out to have severe and far-reaching consequences.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_PBOX">You'd better not open it.</String><String name="ART_NAME_SHENGE">Stonehenge</String><String name="ART_DESC_SHENGE">Stonehenge is a prehistoric monument located in the English county of Wiltshire. It was produced by a culture which has left no written records. Many aspects of Stonehenge remain subject to debate. This multiplicity of theories, some of them very colorful, are often called the "mystery of Stonehenge". A number of myths surround the stones.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_SHENGE">Mysterious stones</String><String name="ART_NAME_LSABER">Lightsaber</String><String name="ART_DESC_LSABER">A Lightsaber is a fictional weapon in the Star Wars universe, a "laser sword." It consists of a polished metal hilt which projects a blade of plasma about 1.33 meters long. The Lightsaber is the signature weapon of the Jedi order and their Sith counterparts, both of whom can use them for close combat, or to deflect blaster bolts.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_LSABER">You can solve this if your midi-chlorian level is high enough.</String><String name="ART_NAME_EIFTOWER">Eiffel tower</String><String name="ART_DESC_EIFTOWER">Erected in 1889 as the entrance arch to the 1889 World's Fair, the Eiffel tower has become both a global cultural icon of France and one of the most recognizable structures in the world. The tower is the tallest structure in Paris and the most-visited paid monument in the world. The tower stands 320 metres tall, about the same height as an 81-storey building.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_EIFTOWER">Paris, Paris...</String><String name="ART_NAME_GRAIL">Holy Grail</String><String name="ART_DESC_GRAIL">An artifact in Christian mythology, it is the cup used by Christ at the Last Supper and in which some of his blood was caught during the crucifixion.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_GRAIL">Many people are looking for it. King Arthur, Indiana Jones...</String><String name="ART_NAME_ROP">Ring of power</String><String name="ART_DESC_ROP">The One Ring was forged by the Dark Lord Sauron during the Second Age in order to gain dominion over the free peoples of Middle-earth. Sauron intended it to be the most powerful of all Rings, able to rule and control those who wore the others. Since the other Rings were themselves powerful, Sauron was obliged to place much of his own power into the One to achieve his purpose.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_ROP">One for the Dark Lord on his dark throne</String><String name="ART_NAME_PYRAMID">Pyramid of Cheops</String><String name="ART_DESC_PYRAMID">The pyramid was originally faced with white limestone that was even harder than the blocks it encased. The pyramid was crowned with a gilded stone. The facing would glow with a peach-like color in the light of the Sun, â€œa shining wonder to which Ra, the god of the Sun, must have given all his rays.â€</String><String name="ART_ENIG_PYRAMID">It is the only one of the seven wonders of the world that has survived to the present day</String><String name="ART_NAME_SPHYNX">Sphinx</String><String name="ART_DESC_SPHYNX">The statue of the Sphinx has its face turned to the Nile and the rising sun. Almost all ancient eastern civilizations saw the lion as a symbol of the sun god. The Sphinx was a sentinel who watched over the eternal rest of the pharaohs interred around him.</String><String name="ART_ENIG_SPHYNX">An enormous lion with a pharaohâ€™s head</String><String name="ART_NUM_OF_ATTEMPTS">Number of Attempts</String><String name="ART_TIME_FOR_RESET_ATTEMPTS">Time remaining until you can try again:</String><String name="ART_HINT_SHORT_DESC_FIFTY_FIFTY">This hint hides half of elements needless for artifact creation.</String><String name="ART_HINT_DESC_FIFTY_FIFTY">This hint hides half of elements needless for artifact creation. Repetitive use hides half of remaining elements.</String><String name="ART_HINT_DESC_SHOW_GROUP">This hint shows groups of all three elements needed to create artifact.</String><String name="ART_HINT_SHORT_DESC_SHOW_ELE">This hint sets one correct element for reaction.</String><String name="ART_HINT_DESC_SHOW_ELE">This hint sets one correct element for reaction. You can use this hint repetitively to compose the whole reaction.</String>Â  Â  <String name="ART_MSG_BUY_FIFTY_FIFTY">Do you want to buy %d "50/50" hints?</String>Â  Â  <String name="ART_MSG_BUY_SHOW_GROUP">Do you want to buy %d "Groups" hints?</String>Â  Â  <String name="ART_MSG_BUY_SHOW_ELE">Do you want to buy %d "Element" hints?</String>    <String name="MSG_NO_MANA">Not enough mana. Go to the bank?</String>    <String name="ART_MSG_NO_MANA">Not enough mana. Go to the bank?</String>    <String name="ART_HELP_P1_M1">1) Choose any 3 elements from the list</String>    <String name="ART_HELP_P2_M1">2) Combine the 3 elements to create an artifact</String>    <String name="ART_HELP_P3_M1">3) Congratulations!</String>    <String name="ART_HELP_P3_M2">You've discovered a new artifact!</String>    <String name="ART_HELP_P4_M1">4) Gather the full artifact collection</String>    <String name="ART_STATUSMAR_MSG_LEFT">Choose Elements</String>    <String name="ART_STATUSMAR_MSG_RIGHT">Create Artifact</String>    <String name="ART_COMING_SOON">COMING SOON</String>    <String name="ART_NAME_BASILISK">Basilisk</String>    <String name="ART_DESC_BASILISK">In the Middle Ages basilisks were considered to really exist. It was thought that basilisks had venomous fangs, claws, and breath, in addition to the fact that, similar to Medusa, they were able to kill with just a look.</String>    <String name="ART_ENIG_BASILISK">One glance from this monstrous creature would turn you into a stone.</String>    <String name="ART_NAME_SLEDGE">Santa's Sleigh</String>    <String name="ART_DESC_SLEDGE">Santa's sleigh was originally only pulled by eight reindeer: Dasher, Dancer, Prancer, Vixen, Comet, Cupid, Donner, and Blitzen. Rudolph joined the classic Eight in 1939 in a song by Robert L. May and soon became the most famous reindeer of the whole team.</String>    <String name="ART_ENIG_SLEDGE">What does Santa ride to deliver his gifts?</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="CREDITS_ORIGINAL_IDEA">Original Idea</String><String name="CREDITS_GAME_DESIGNER">Game Design</String><String name="CREDITS_LEAD_ARTIST">Lead Artist</String><String name="CREDITS_ARTIST">Artist</String><String name="CREDITS_PROGRAMMER">Software Development</String><String name="CREDITS_SOUND">Sound Atmosphere</String><String name="CREDITS_SPECIAL_THANKS">Special Thanks To:</String><String name="CREDITS_TRANSLATE">Localization</String><String name="Anton Rybakov">Anton Rybakov</String><String name="Nick Kotlyarov">Nick Kotlyarov</String><String name="Imya Familiya">Imya Familiya</String><String name="Alexey Krivorotko">Alexey Krivorotko</String><String name="Vladimir Schmidthof">Vladimir Schmidthof</String><String name="Strategic Music">Strategic Music</String><String name="Somatone Interactive">Somatone Interactive</String><String name="Elegar Helfrid">Elegar Helfrid</String><String name="Alexey Zbritsky">Alexey Zbritsky</String><String name="Alexey Dyadchanko">Alexey Dyadchenko</String><String name="Mihail Perepelkin">Mihail Perepelkin</String><String name="Alexey Schekin-Gelmer">Alexey Schekin-Gelmer</String><String name="Artem Titov">Artem Titov</String><String name="Vladimir Klubkov">Vladimir Klubkov</String><String name="Vitaliy Tulnikov">Vitaliy Tulnikov</String><String name="Roma