 this minigame for mana?</String><String name="SWITCHED_TO_EPISODE">You switched to episode "%s"</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_SHARE_ACHIEVEMENT">Do you want to share this achievement with friends?</String><String name="TIMER_HOURS_MINUTES">%dh{{color=%08x}}:{{/color}}%02dm</String><String name="TIMER_DAYS">%dd</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_DAYS_HOURS">{1}d {2}h</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_HOURS_MINUTES">{2}h {3}m</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_MINUTES_SECONDS">{3}m {4}s</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_SECONDS">{4}s</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_HOURS_MINUTES_SECONDS">{2}h {3}m {4}s</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_DAYS_HOURS_LEFT">{1}d {2}h left</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_HOURS_MINUTES_LEFT">{2}h {3}m left</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_MINUTES_SECONDS_LEFT">{3}m {4}s left</String><String name="FORMAT_TIME_SECONDS_LEFT">{4}s left</String><String name="ACTION_HEADER">Sale!</String><String name="ACTION_BANK_MSG">Buy mana and get prizes!</String><String name="ACTION_TIMER_MSG">Sale ends in:</String><String name="ACTION_SHOP_MSG">Hurry to get a discount!</String><String name="ACTION_BUY_NOW">Buy now</String><String name="ACTION_NOW_ONLY">Only now</String><String name="ACTION_BEST_VALUE">Best value!</String><String name="ACTION_MOST_POPULAR">Most popular!</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_FIRECRACKER">4th of July Fireworks Fun!</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_FIRECRACKER_DESC">Can You create a big Firecracker?</String><String name="PUZ_FIRECRACKER_WIN_MSG">Hurray! Now we can launch fireworks!</String><String name="FIND_ARTIFACTS">Find artifacts</String><String name="SKIP_FOR_MANA">Skip for</String><String name="SKIP_AND_PLAY">Skip</String><String name="CONGRATULATIONS">Congratulations!</String><String name="YOU_DISCAVERY_EPISODE">Episode %s is completed and all artifacts are opened!</String><String name="YOU_DISCAVERY_EPISODE2">Episode %s is completed but not all artifacts are opened.</String><String name="FOR_CONTINUE_PLAYING">You need to open all artifacts to continue playing.</String><String name="FOR_CONTINUE_PLAYING2">Try to find missing artifacts</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_EXIT_GAME">Are you sure you want to exit the game?</String><String name="BUTTON_TEXT_EULA">End User License Agreement</String><String name="BUTTON_TEXT_PP">Privacy Policy</String><String name="BUTTON_TEXT_TOS">Terms of Service</String><String name="LICENSE_EULA">http://tos.ea.com/legalapp/mobileeula/US/en/GM/</String><String name="LICENSE_PP">http://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACY/US/en/PC/</String><String name="LICENSE_TOS">http://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBTERMS/US/en/PC/</String><String name="QUESTS_SCR_EGYPT">The Rise of Egypt</String><String name="QUESTS_SCR_EGYPT_DESC">Create a great civilization amid the lifeless desert</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_1">There are some places on the planet that Doodle God made completely uninhabitable</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_2">However, you have the power to create a mighty civilization even in the desert</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_3">Ancient Egypt left behind an enormous cultural heritage for world civilization</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_4">Even in antiquity, Egyptian works of art were transported all over the world</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_5">Unique architectural forms â€” majestic pyramids, temples, palaces, and obelisks</String><String name="TEASER_EGYPT_6">fired the imagination of travelers and researchers for many centuries.</String><String name="QUESTEGYPT_PROGRESS_OBJECTIVES">Your goal is to create items from Egyptian civilization</String><String name="QUESTEGYPT_COMPLETE">The foundation of Egyptian civilization has been laid!</String><String name="GAMEOVER_DOWNLOAD_BLITZ">Upgrade to Blitz</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_NO_GLOW">Power of the Glow exhausted. Recharge it or you'll have to spend mana to unlock all new elements!</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_TAVERN">Tavern</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_TAVERN_DESC">Build a building that will make people happy!</String><String name="DAILY_BONUS_GET_REWARD">Get Reward</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_ANDROID">Android</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_ANDROID_DESC">Create your own operating system</String><String name="PUZ_ANDROID_WIN_MSG">Congratulations! You have created another version of Android!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FACEBOOK_CONNECT_ERROR">Failed to connect to Facebook. Try again?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_TWITTER_CONNECT_ERROR">Failed to connect to Twitter. Try again?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_GOOGLEPLUS_CONNECT_ERROR">Failed to connect to Google+. Try again?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_MORE_ELEMENTS">More unlocked elements were found in the server's saved game data than on this device!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_LESS_ELEMENTS">More unlocked elements were found on this device than in the saved game data on the server!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_UPLOAD_SUCCESS">Game progress successfully saved to the server!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_UPLOAD_ERROR">Failed to save current saved game data to the server. Try again?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_DOWNLOAD_ERROR">Failed to load saved game data from the server. Try again?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_REPLACE_SUCCESS">Saved game data successfully loaded from the server!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_UPLOAD_WARNING">The saved game data on the server will be replaced with local data. Continue?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_DOWNLOAD_WARNING">Local saved game data will be replaced with data from the server. Continue?</String><String name="BUY_THIS_INAPP">Buy this inapp?</String><String name="BUY_THIS_INAPP_EMULATED">--== STORE EMULATOR ==--\nBuy this inapp?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_ELEMENTS">elements</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_DESC">Now you can save your current progress on the server and continue playing on another device!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_UPLOAD_HINT">Tap to save your progress to the server</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_DOWNLOAD_HINT">Tap to load your progress from the server</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_UPLOAD">Upload</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_DOWNLOAD">Download</String><String name="SEE_FULL_REACTION">See full reaction</String><String name="FULL_REACTION">Full reaction for %element</String><String name="FULL_REACTION_BOUGHT">Congratulations! Now you know how to create the %element!</String><String name="QUEST_ADVERTISING_MSG">Get into the wild in a new exciting quest! Feel yourself a real Robinson Crusoe!</String><String name="QUEST_ADVERTISING_BUTTON">To the quest</String><String name="BTN_GO_TO_QUEST">To quests</String><String name="BTN_GO_TO_SHOP">To the store</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_FACEBOOK">You have to log into Facebook to synchronize your progress.</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_EMPTY_ERROR">You have not saved your progress from any device yet. Would you like to save from this device?</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_SAME_ELEMENTS">The progress on this device contains the same number of unlocked elements as the progress on the server.</String><String name="QUESTS_SCR_QAD">The Angel and the Imp</String><String name="QUESTS_SCR_QAD_DESC">One day, an Imp and an Angel strolled into the Doodle God's office...</String><String name="TEASER_QAD_1">One day, an Imp and an Angel strolled into the Doodle God's office...</String><String name="TEASER_QAD_2">And caused quite a commotion</String><String name="TEASER_QAD_3">Give the Imp and the Angel various elements and see what happens</String><String name="QUESTQAD_COMPLETE">And so, just by playing around, the Angel and Imp created an entire world!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_TITLE">Connect to Facebook!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_HEAD">Connect right now and receive some nice bonuses!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_BONUS_1">Play with your friends!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_BONUS_2">Receive gifts!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_BONUS_4">Common progress for all devices!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_BONUS_3">Free mana!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT">Connect!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_FB_CONNECT_REWARD">You have connected to Facebook. This is for you:</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_GP_CONNECT_TITLE">Log in to Play Games Services</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_GP_CONNECT_BONUS_1">- Share your progress with friends</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_GP_CONNECT_BONUS_2">Achievments -</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_GP_CONNECT_REWARD">You have connected to Google Plus. This is for you:</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_UPDATE_TITLE">New Version Available!</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_UPDATE_DESC">Please dowload the latest version of Doodle God.</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_UPDATE_DO">Update game</String><String name="1ELEMENTS">element</String><String name="x1ELEMENTS">elements</String><String name="1xELEMENTS">elements</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_MAIN_GAME_ELEMENTS">in the main game</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_QUESTS_ELEMENTS">in quests</String><String name="MESSAGEBOX_CLOUD_PUZZLES_ELEMENTS">in puzzles</String><String name="PUZ_SNOW_WIN_MSG">The inhabitants of the Doodle God world are thrilled! Snow has finally arrived!</String><String name="PUZ_XMASTREE_WIN_MSG">You've got a Christmas Tree. Don't forget about the gifts! :)</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_SNOW">White Christmas</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_SNOW_DESC">Help Make it Snow!</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_XMASTREE">Holiday Tree</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_XMASTREE_DESC">Help Santa build a Tree!</String><String name="BLITZ_UNLOCK_TITLE">Unlock the full version!</String><String name="BLITZ_UNLOCK_TITLE2">BLITZ!</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_LOVE">All you need is Love</String><String name="PUZZLES_SCR_LOVE_DESC">Arm your angel to Valentines Day!</String><St