Spell book,"Aparecium - this spell makes invisible ink appear.","List of spells in Harry Potter"
Spell book,"Orchideous - this spell makes a bouquet of flowers appear out of the caster's wand.","List of spells in Harry Potter"
Spore,"A spore a day, keeps the boredom away.","Arkanay"
Spore,"If you've got a spore, protect it.","galxyofpower"
Spore,"THIS...IS...SPORTA!!!!!!!","galxyofpower"
Styx,"Don't pay the ferryman before he gets you to the other side","Proverb"
Submarine,"We all live in a yellow submarine!","The Beatles"
Succubus,"Seduction is merely encouraging a man to do something he already wants to do.","Lisa Kleypas"
Suffering,"The heart was made to be broken","Oscar Wilde"
Surveillance,"Big Brother is watching you.","truth"
Terrorism,"The war against terrorism is terrorism","Woody Harrelson"
TNT,"Desire, like the atom, is explosive with creative force","Paul Vernon Buser"
Tsunami,"In general, the impact of the tsunami is a lot less than the human impact.","Clive Wilkinson"
Tsunami,"The election is not a tsunami where you need the help of an army to rescue people.","Ibrahim Lipumba"
Tsunami,"This is not a ripple effect. This is a tsunami.","Jennifer Dunn"
Vacuum bomb,"We can destroy ourselves by cynicism and disillusion, just as effectively as by bombs","Kenneth Clark"
War,"We make war that we may live in peace","Aristotle"
Witch,"I'm not a Witch; I'm your wife","The Princess Bride"
Wolf,"Fear makes the wolf bigger than he is","Proverb"

Snow,"Snow is a magical veil that hides everything ugly, turning any place into a Winter wonderland!"
Snow,"Don't complain about the snow on your neighbor's roof when your own doorstep is unclean.","Confucius"
Xmastree,"The best Valentine's Day gift is to finally take down the Christmas tree!"
Xmastree,"I put my darling's gift under the tree!\nSo where is she?\nOut looking. The forest is a big place!"

Love bow,"Without love we are nothing more than an empty canvas...","Philip T. M."
Love bow,"There is no fear in the word LOVE! For LOVE does not know fear...","Philip T. M."

Postcard,"Everything in the world exists to end up as a postcard.","Tom Phillips"
Postcard,"Send me things in the mail. Wherever you go, I donâ€™t care where you go, just send me something in the mail from where you are.","Wallace Berman"

Sheep,"Sheep have rectangular pupils just like mongooses and octopuses. ",
Sheep,"Sheep inhabit almost every continent. ",
Horse,"There are almost 160 different breeds of horses around the world. However, the Arabian is unique in that it is the purest of them all. ",
Horse,"Horses are able to open bolted doors in other pens, releasing their co-captives. ",

Nest,"A German legend says that Easter Bunny leaves a nest full of painted eggs as a gift to good children." ,
Easter Egg,"Painted eggs are gifted during Easter. Since ancient times, the egg is a symbol of fertility and rebirth." ,
Rabbit,"Hares can be seen in any country, as they are one of the most widespread mammals on Earth.",
Rabbit,"When it rains, hares press their ears to their heads to keep out rain and avoid getting sick.",
Rabbit,"Hare teeth grow throughout their entire lives, getting ground down while eating.",
Decorated house,"A festive winter house"


Lightning, "Electricity is really just organized lightning.", George Carlin
Lightning, "Thunder is good, thunder is impressive; but it is lightning that does the work.", Mark Twain
Ice storm, "When you come out of the storm, you wonâ€™t be the same person who walked in. Thatâ€™s what this stormâ€™s all about.", Haruki Murakami
Rainbow, "It takes both the sun and the rain to make a beautiful rainbow.", Cinderella
Rainbow, "Youâ€™ll never find a rainbow if youâ€™re looking down.", Charlie Chaplin
Rust, "Just as iron rusts from disuse... even so does inaction spoil the intellect.", Leonardo da Vinci

Mud, "You pray for rain, you gotta deal with the mud too. That's a part of it.", Denzel Washington
Mud, "He who slings mud loses ground.", Gautama Buddha
Oasis, "On your journey to your dream, be ready to face oasis and deserts. In both cases, don't stop.", Paulo Coelho
Carnivorous flower,	"My body is a carnivorous flower, a poisonous houseplant, a loaded gun with a million triggers and he's more than ready to fire.", Tahereh Mafi
Pie, "Promises and pie-crust are made to be broken.", Jonathan Swift
NanoBot, "The biggest fatal flaw in most fictional portrayals of nanotech - what sends those books arcing across the room - is ignoring that the nanobots need energy to do ... anything.", "Edward M. Lerner"
Paints, "I want to paint the way a bird sings.", Claude Monet
Bottle, "A tavern is a place where madness is sold by the bottle.", Jonathan Swift
Rain, "Without rain, there is no life.", Jerry Yang
Frost, "If you tell a joke in the forest, but nobody laughs, was it a joke?", Stephen Wright
Waterfall, "Nature is the art of God.", Dante Alighieri
Camel, "A camel makes an elephant feel like a jet plane.", Jackie Kennedy
Camel, "Do not free a camel of the burden of his hump; you may be freeing him from being a camel.", "Gilbert K. Chesterton"
Pyramid, "From the heights of these pyramids, forty centuries look down on us.", Napoleon Bonaparte

Volcano, "All civilization has from time to time become a thin crust over a volcano of revolution.",Havelock Ellis
Jellyfish, "The gelatinous body of jellyfish contain a total of 24 eyes, but no brain.",
Shark, "Sharks do not have a swimming bladder. If they stop swimming, they sink.",
Shark, "When a shark's tooth falls out or breaks, a new one grows in within 24 hours. Sharks can go through 30,000 teeth in their lifetime, and the new ones are always bigger, making older sharks appear scarier.",
Torch, "The generations of living things pass in a short time, and like runners hand on the torch of life.","Lucretius"
Yeti, "Yetis gained notoriety after 1958 when Gerald Crew showed the media a plaster cast of a footprint he found while working for a road construction company. But it was no more than a prank."

Cloud,"Clouds come floating into my life, no longer to carry rain or usher storm, but to add color to my sunset sky.",Rabindranath Tagore
Rockshaper,"Through my hands, mountains rise and valleys deepen. I am the master of the earth's structure.",Rockshaper


Flatlands,"In the vast expanse of the Flatlands, where horizon meets eternity, simplicity finds its beauty.",Unknown
Grave,"Amidst the silence of the grave, whispers of eternity echo.",Unknown
Graveyard,"Hidden amidst the tombstones, whispers of forgotten stories echo... in the realm of the Graveyard, life finds its eternal peace.",Unknown
Innkeeper,"An innkeeper serves as the guardian of tales and the keeper of wanderers' dreams.",Unknown
Lake,"Like a tranquil mirror, the lake reflects nature's beauty and offers a peaceful sanctuary for the weary soul.",Unknown
Plowman,"Like the plowman tills the land, perseverance furrows the path to success.",Unknown
Rusty weapon,"From the ashes of battles long past, the rusty weapon stands as a testament to the passage of time, reminding us of the price we pay for a fleeting victory.",Unknown
Smith,"From the fiery forge of passion and skill, the Smith hammers dreams into reality.",Unknown
Water lily,"Like a delicate whisper, the water lily blooms, embracing the tranquil dance of water and light.",Unknown
Pickaxe,"Pickaxe: Unearth the treasures of perseverance, for with every strike, the path to abundance reveals itself.",Unknown
T-Rex,"Within the jaws of time, the T-Rex roared, a majestic testament to the earth's ancient power.",Unknown

Bee,"Bee populations in Europe and America have been dropping quickly since the winter of 2006. The artificial appearance of CCD (Colony Collapse Disorder) has destroyed millions of hives. ",
Bee,"If bee populations continue to be reduced at the current rate, they will go extinct by 2035. ",
Bee,"It takes 500 bee stings to kill a healthy adult human. ",
Bee,"Bees cannot remove their stinger after stinging a person and die as a result. ",
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_0">%s found out how to make {3} by combining {1} with {2}!</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_1">%s was trying very hard to invent {3} until finally combined {1} and {2}.</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_2">%s wants to share a secret recipe of {3} with you! It's {1} combined with {2}, but don't tell anyone ;)</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_3">Still wondering how to make {3}? %s has found out that it is {1} combined with {2}.</String><String name="SOCIAL_TEMPLATE_4">%s combined {1} with {2} just for fun, and was very surprised to get {3}</String><String name="SOCIAL_FOUND">I've found a new element!</String><String name="SOCIAL_AND">and</String><String name="SOCIAL_USERNAME_DUMMY">Your friend</String><String name="SOCIAL_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">I discovered that %s + %s = %s! Get Doodle God -</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TEMPLATE">Wow! I've just earned new achievement: "%s".\nAnd what have you achieved in Doodle God?\nVisit our site www.doodlegod.com and check out latest news.\nPlay Doodle Devil - unleash your Dark Side!</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TEMPLATE_SHORT">Wow! I've just earned new achievement: "%s".</String><String name="SOCIAL_ACHIEVEMENT_TWITTER_TEMPLATE">Wow! I've just earned new achievement: "%s".\nPlay Doodle Devil - unleash your Dark Side!</String></Localization><?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Localization><String name="BLITZ_UNLOCK_DESC">Â¡Compra la versiÃ³n completa del juego por solo %d manÃ¡, y consigue Brillo eterno y acceso libre a todos los episodios! Â¡Se acabaron las esperas o los objetos bloqueados!</String><String name="QUEST_PRINCESS_ADVERTISING_MSG">Â¡Ha ocurrido algo terrible! Â¡Un dragÃ³n ha secuestrado a la princesa y solo tÃº puedes salvarla! Â¡Date prisa!</String><String name="QUEST_PRINCESS_ADVERTISING_BUTTON">Â¡A la batalla!</String><String name="QUEST_DEVIL_VS_GOD_ADVERTISING_MSG">El bien y el mal se enfrentarÃ¡